      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "似乎也是不向逆境屈服，\n代表强韧力量的花语……\n我对神鹰如此说明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "324eacb2d2e84cddccddbcd8f39c55a7f553b57c6ef0480439c3f267694b38a5",
